WEBVTT

00:45.416 --> 00:46.832
When will the DA file?

00:46.833 --> 00:49.124
Press conference
is scheduled for tomorrow morning.

00:49.125 --> 00:50.457
The arrest warrant is already out,

00:50.458 --> 00:52.583
and they're picking up
David Burroughs now.

00:53.083 --> 00:54.375
Will it stick?

00:57.416 --> 00:58.375
It'll stick.

01:00.583 --> 01:01.874
What about the lab?

01:01.875 --> 01:02.957
Handled.

01:02.958 --> 01:05.624
It was expensive,
but the DNA results will confirm

01:05.625 --> 01:07.250
that the body found in the bed

01:08.083 --> 01:09.458
was Matthew Burroughs.

01:16.750 --> 01:19.291
- Well, do you have something for me?
- I do.

01:20.958 --> 01:23.749
- Were you careful?
- Nothing can trace back to you.

01:23.750 --> 01:25.290
I, um…

01:25.291 --> 01:26.832
I made sure of it.

01:26.833 --> 01:27.833
Oh, good.

01:28.583 --> 01:32.458
After everything I've done to protect you,
you'd better hope so.

02:25.625 --> 02:27.791
Ronald, David. David, Ronald.

02:28.666 --> 02:30.666
What the hell are you guys doing here?

02:33.000 --> 02:34.125
We need your help.

02:34.708 --> 02:36.333
Whatever you want,
you can forget about it.

02:36.916 --> 02:39.915
- Okay, Ron.
- Do you know how much it cost me? Hmm?

02:39.916 --> 02:42.333
Why in the hell would I ever help you?

02:42.875 --> 02:45.207
Because the person who took my son
works at your hospital.

02:45.208 --> 02:49.250
We're sure you're the only one
who can help us get him back.

02:58.125 --> 02:59.915
Pick up. Come on.

02:59.916 --> 03:01.499
Come on. Pick up. Come on. Pick up.

03:01.500 --> 03:03.958
Come on, come on. Pick up.

03:06.875 --> 03:09.083
Hey, it's me. We gotta leave town.

03:09.666 --> 03:11.790
Tonight. I'm leaving here in an hour.

03:11.791 --> 03:12.708
Be ready.

03:14.666 --> 03:17.540
Here you go. Have a good one.

03:17.541 --> 03:18.750
Theo.

03:19.333 --> 03:20.749
We need to go home.

03:20.750 --> 03:22.208
I thought we were going to the park.

03:23.041 --> 03:24.375
Change of plans.

03:25.416 --> 03:27.125
Come on, let's go.

03:29.041 --> 03:30.749
What does it say?

03:30.750 --> 03:32.208
Just relax.

03:32.833 --> 03:34.082
That bad?

03:34.083 --> 03:35.207
It's a bit high.

03:35.208 --> 03:37.415
Well, if you want it lower,
you can always send me home

03:37.416 --> 03:38.875
so I can get some real food.

03:40.041 --> 03:41.458
How's our patient doing?

03:46.000 --> 03:47.624
I see you're making friends.

03:47.625 --> 03:49.999
She doesn't appreciate my charm.

03:50.000 --> 03:52.624
I know the doctors are concerned
about you eating healthy,

03:52.625 --> 03:54.332
so I made a stop on my way back from home…

03:54.333 --> 03:57.375
Sarah, I love you,
but if you pull a salad out of that bag…

03:58.208 --> 03:59.041
I…

04:00.458 --> 04:01.582
Do you want it?

04:01.583 --> 04:04.250
I could-- I could take it back home
and have it myself.

04:06.041 --> 04:08.790
Figured a bullet didn't kill you,
so one cheeseburger won't.

04:08.791 --> 04:10.625
Like I said, I love you.

04:14.250 --> 04:15.415
Yeah.

04:15.416 --> 04:18.124
Sarah, David and Rachel
just broke into Berg Reproductive.

04:18.125 --> 04:20.125
- What?
- What?

04:20.958 --> 04:22.083
Okay, thanks.

04:23.416 --> 04:24.582
That was Chopra.

04:24.583 --> 04:27.290
David Burroughs and Rachel Mills
just broke into some place

04:27.291 --> 04:29.999
called Berg Reproductive Partners
less than an hour ago.

04:30.000 --> 04:32.582
The whole city is hunting for these two,

04:32.583 --> 04:34.957
and they make a pit stop
at a fertility clinic?

04:34.958 --> 04:36.999
- How the hell does that add up?
- There's more.

04:37.000 --> 04:38.624
Hayden Payne was with them.

04:38.625 --> 04:41.082
BPD arrested him on suspicion
of aiding and abetting.

04:41.083 --> 04:44.957
Now listen, BPD's not gonna
let you talk to Hayden Payne,

04:44.958 --> 04:48.790
but you need to go over to Berg and see
what the hell they were doing there.

04:48.791 --> 04:51.749
And Sarah, be careful.

04:51.750 --> 04:53.874
If Julie finds out
you're still investigating,

04:53.875 --> 04:55.291
she's coming for your badge.

04:59.958 --> 05:01.083
Agent Greer.

05:02.000 --> 05:05.957
Detective Daniel Müller, Swiss police.
I just came from the FBI field office.

05:05.958 --> 05:08.915
- I left you a message.
- Right, of course you did. I'm sorry.

05:08.916 --> 05:12.290
No need to apologize.
I heard about your father. Is he okay?

05:12.291 --> 05:16.832
He's okay. Yeah, he'll be fine.
He's grumpy, but he'll be just fine.

05:16.833 --> 05:18.500
Uh, I reviewed your file.

05:19.041 --> 05:22.165
You really think that your missing boy
is connected to the Burroughs case?

05:22.166 --> 05:23.999
I wouldn't have come
halfway around the world

05:24.000 --> 05:26.000
if I didn't think it was a possibility.

05:27.458 --> 05:28.416
Okay.

05:29.291 --> 05:31.958
- Tell me more about it on the way.
- Where are we going?

05:32.958 --> 05:34.666
To solve both of our cases.

05:36.500 --> 05:38.915
Police are investigating
a reported break-in

05:38.916 --> 05:42.332
at Berg Reproductive
involving escaped convict David Burroughs.

05:42.333 --> 05:45.749
He remains at large after a failed attempt
to capture him this morning.

05:45.750 --> 05:49.999
Boston police are urging anyone
with information to come forward,

05:50.000 --> 05:53.624
but again they emphasize that
if you see Burroughs, do not approach.

05:53.625 --> 05:55.707
This man is armed and highly dangerous.

05:55.708 --> 05:57.915
Anyone with any information is asked to…

05:57.916 --> 05:58.915
What is it?

05:58.916 --> 06:01.749
Hayden was arrested
helping David Burroughs

06:01.750 --> 06:04.540
and Rachel Mills
break into Berg Reproductive.

06:04.541 --> 06:06.583
BPD has him on traffic cameras.

06:09.583 --> 06:10.958
Where is he?

06:17.250 --> 06:18.458
I didn't call you.

06:19.000 --> 06:21.040
And yet, here I am. Go figure.

06:21.041 --> 06:24.124
I'm supposed to believe
my mother's worried about my well-being?

06:24.125 --> 06:27.290
I don't care what you believe.
I'm not your therapist, I'm your lawyer.

06:27.291 --> 06:28.458
Where's Rachel?

06:28.958 --> 06:32.040
Rachel Mills and David Burroughs
are still at large.

06:32.041 --> 06:33.125
Hm.

06:35.166 --> 06:36.291
I'm not signing it.

06:36.916 --> 06:39.040
Whatever it is my mother has cooked up.

06:39.041 --> 06:42.707
They took me hostage, held me at gunpoint,
forced me to help them.

06:42.708 --> 06:44.040
How am I doing so far?

06:44.041 --> 06:46.165
From where I'm sitting, not well.

06:46.166 --> 06:47.582
Let me tell you something.

06:47.583 --> 06:49.832
I get paid no matter
how long you rot in jail.

06:49.833 --> 06:52.290
In fact, my trial fees
are where I really cash in.

06:52.291 --> 06:54.874
So I'm happy to sit beside you
in court for the next six months

06:54.875 --> 06:57.457
before you're sent to prison,
if that's how you wanna play it.

06:57.458 --> 06:59.582
Look, she has gone way too far this time.

06:59.583 --> 07:02.125
Sounds like a conversation
for the two of you to have.

07:03.791 --> 07:04.833
After you sign.

07:06.750 --> 07:08.790
I interviewed Dr. Heller
at his psych visit,

07:08.791 --> 07:10.249
and his background check was clean.

07:10.250 --> 07:12.457
I know, Hayden's mother covered it all up.

07:12.458 --> 07:13.458
So where is he now?

07:15.333 --> 07:16.624
He's at the hospital. He's on call.

07:16.625 --> 07:19.125
- So he's probably doing rounds.
- That's where we go then.

07:20.166 --> 07:21.000
Are you crazy?

07:22.000 --> 07:23.457
The hospital's crawling with cops.

07:23.458 --> 07:25.290
They've been watching Cheryl
ever since you came back.

07:25.291 --> 07:28.790
And now the FBI's there
because one of their guys got shot.

07:28.791 --> 07:31.041
If you go there, you will be caught.

07:37.291 --> 07:39.583
No, we won't.

07:41.416 --> 07:42.708
'Cause you can sneak us in.

07:43.833 --> 07:46.332
- Excuse me?
- You're the hospital administrator, right?

07:46.333 --> 07:51.082
You must have a key card that gives you
access to restricted areas, right?

07:51.083 --> 07:52.999
- Yeah, but--
- So you can help us avoid the cops.

07:53.000 --> 07:55.166
Yeah, and what happens
if we get caught, hmm?

07:56.666 --> 07:59.000
I'm not risking
getting arrested for you two.

07:59.708 --> 08:01.000
It's not for us.

08:02.958 --> 08:04.166
It's for Cheryl.

08:05.416 --> 08:06.875
She wants her son back.

08:07.500 --> 08:09.083
Matthew's alive.

08:11.208 --> 08:13.250
And you can help bring him home.

08:17.875 --> 08:19.832
The orphanage said that Martin ran away,

08:19.833 --> 08:22.665
but I always suspected that something
more nefarious had happened.

08:22.666 --> 08:24.124
You think he was kidnapped?

08:24.125 --> 08:27.415
Martin vanished three weeks before
Matthew Burroughs was supposedly killed.

08:27.416 --> 08:29.790
Same age, height, hair.

08:29.791 --> 08:34.082
Okay, but how does a missing boy
in Switzerland end up murdered in Boston?

08:34.083 --> 08:37.957
Well, the orphanage was privately funded
by a family out of Boston,

08:37.958 --> 08:39.208
the Payne Foundation.

08:39.791 --> 08:40.707
What?

08:40.708 --> 08:41.958
You know the name?

08:43.750 --> 08:47.249
Hayden Payne was arrested for helping
Rachel Mills and David Burroughs

08:47.250 --> 08:49.749
break into the place
we're going right now.

08:49.750 --> 08:50.583
You're kidding.

08:51.250 --> 08:52.874
That doesn't make any sense.

08:52.875 --> 08:57.041
If the Paynes were somehow involved,
why would he be helping them?

08:57.750 --> 08:59.333
Maybe he doesn't know.

09:00.083 --> 09:02.040
So what happened to the orphanage?

09:02.041 --> 09:05.040
Well, it was closed down
before I could conduct an investigation

09:05.041 --> 09:06.582
into Martin's disappearance.

09:06.583 --> 09:10.625
Okay, even if the body that was found
that night in the bed was Martin,

09:11.625 --> 09:13.625
there is no way to prove it.

09:14.875 --> 09:15.791
Actually, there is.

09:16.583 --> 09:18.415
Martin had a rare genetic disorder.

09:18.416 --> 09:20.332
Um, MLD.

09:20.333 --> 09:22.249
Metachromatic leukodystrophy.

09:22.250 --> 09:23.790
That would show up in a DNA test.

09:23.791 --> 09:27.624
You test the blood from the crime scene
and it comes back positive for MLD,

09:27.625 --> 09:31.915
we have proof that the body
they found that night was Martin.

09:31.916 --> 09:34.749
Which would mean that Matthew Burroughs
could still be alive,

09:34.750 --> 09:36.750
and his father is innocent.

09:41.625 --> 09:43.665
- Hey.
- Hey, Dad.

09:43.666 --> 09:46.749
I need you to call
the Boston Crime Lab and order

09:46.750 --> 09:49.707
a DNA test on the blood found
at Matthew Burroughs's crime scene.

09:49.708 --> 09:54.290
They're not gonna run a DNA test
on a case that closed five years ago.

09:54.291 --> 09:56.541
Please, just do this for me.

09:58.625 --> 10:00.250
Okay, what are you looking for?

10:09.333 --> 10:11.415
Uh, I was doing you a solid when I called.

10:11.416 --> 10:14.124
I didn't mean for you to come down here.
Julie finds out, she's gonna be pissed.

10:14.125 --> 10:16.540
- Respectfully, I don't care.
- I mean at me.

10:16.541 --> 10:19.290
Okay? So whatever you're planning
on doing-- I'm sorry, who is this?

10:19.291 --> 10:21.957
Detective Inspector Daniel Müller,
Swiss police.

10:21.958 --> 10:23.999
Do we know why Burroughs broke in?

10:24.000 --> 10:26.833
No, Hayden Payne got them inside.
His family owns Berg.

10:27.541 --> 10:30.165
- Are there any witnesses?
- No, the place was closed.

10:30.166 --> 10:34.332
Okay, so Burroughs
was not looking for someone,

10:34.333 --> 10:36.458
but he was definitely looking
for something.

10:37.208 --> 10:39.625
- Like what?
- Like patient information.

10:44.791 --> 10:47.707
All right, most programs have
a backdoor admin or passkey

10:47.708 --> 10:49.207
that businesses don't bother to purge

10:49.208 --> 10:51.582
from the directory subset
once the program's installed.

10:51.583 --> 10:53.958
It's a common mistake
that usually goes unnoticed.

10:56.708 --> 10:57.958
And…

10:58.708 --> 10:59.957
we're in.

10:59.958 --> 11:03.457
Okay, let's see
what you were looking for, Burroughs.

11:03.458 --> 11:06.833
Patient records, recent history…

11:12.041 --> 11:13.333
What?

11:14.000 --> 11:15.874
That's… weird.

11:15.875 --> 11:18.332
He was looking up his ex-wife, Cheryl.

11:18.333 --> 11:21.457
There are no search results, though.
She's not a patient here.

11:21.458 --> 11:24.124
You know, I really could've used you
when I was working financial crimes.

11:24.125 --> 11:26.040
You wouldn't believe how many
firewalls I had to hack through

11:26.041 --> 11:27.708
when I was chasing
those offshore accounts.

11:29.541 --> 11:32.040
Have you ever hacked
any accounts in the Caymans?

11:32.041 --> 11:33.874
More than one. Why?

11:33.875 --> 11:36.707
There was a prison guard at Briggs
named Ted Wesson.

11:36.708 --> 11:38.374
He was paid to keep tabs on Burroughs,

11:38.375 --> 11:40.499
and the money came
from an account in the Caymans.

11:40.500 --> 11:42.874
I could have a look.
What was the name on the account?

11:42.875 --> 11:45.249
- REH Holdings.
- Okay.

11:45.250 --> 11:47.874
Will you take Detective Müller
back to use your computer?

11:47.875 --> 11:48.916
Where are you going?

11:49.625 --> 11:52.416
Back to the hospital.
I need to talk to Cheryl Dreason.

12:13.458 --> 12:15.790
You two wait here.
I'm gonna check the freight elevator.

12:15.791 --> 12:18.000
Once it's clear, I'll bring you up.

12:40.083 --> 12:40.958
You okay?

12:43.041 --> 12:46.290
You know, when I called you on the plane
and told you that Matthew may not be mine,

12:46.291 --> 12:47.208
for a second, I…

12:49.000 --> 12:50.625
questioned everything.

12:52.916 --> 12:54.625
And I thought about when he was born.

12:55.416 --> 12:57.416
When I first held him,

12:58.875 --> 13:02.125
and his-- His hand
could barely fit around my pinkie.

13:03.541 --> 13:05.541
He had this perfect little smile.

13:06.541 --> 13:07.541
And, um…

13:08.625 --> 13:11.541
I used to have to drive him around
at night to get him to sleep.

13:14.333 --> 13:16.333
I thought about the first time that he…

13:17.541 --> 13:18.750
that he walked.

13:21.166 --> 13:23.291
First time that-- That he called me Dad.

13:31.458 --> 13:33.541
And no matter what, he's my son.

13:35.375 --> 13:36.458
He's my son.

14:01.333 --> 14:04.166
- We need to go over a few things.
- Get the fuck away from me.

14:09.958 --> 14:11.790
Your call has been forwarded

14:11.791 --> 14:14.040
to an automatic voice message system.

14:14.041 --> 14:15.125
Hey, it's me.

14:15.916 --> 14:19.916
Uh, I had to cut a deal to get out.
I am so sorry. I…

14:20.916 --> 14:23.124
I wish this could've gone a different way.

14:23.125 --> 14:24.957
Look, I'm gonna go to my mother's estate,

14:24.958 --> 14:27.624
and then I'm gonna take off
for a little while.

14:27.625 --> 14:29.582
I-I need to clear my head.

14:29.583 --> 14:32.000
But there's something I need you to know.

14:33.916 --> 14:35.958
I love you, Rachel.

14:37.583 --> 14:38.875
Forever. It's…

14:40.041 --> 14:42.250
All I ever wanted was to be with you.

14:46.208 --> 14:48.166
I love you. Always will.

14:54.666 --> 14:56.707
I reserved an operating room
in pediatrics.

14:56.708 --> 14:58.582
No one will be able
to access it without my key card,

14:58.583 --> 15:00.915
so you guys will be safe to wait there.

15:00.916 --> 15:02.791
Assuming we make it there.

15:19.291 --> 15:22.708
Hey, you got this, all right?
No one's expecting us to be here.

15:24.166 --> 15:27.040
And once I find Heller
and bring him to you?

15:27.041 --> 15:28.000
What then, huh?

15:51.166 --> 15:52.541
Ronald.

15:55.125 --> 15:57.374
I, uh, saw that you booked an OR,

15:57.375 --> 16:00.333
but I didn't see
a surgery scheduled on the board.

16:01.875 --> 16:04.999
Uh-- Uh, that's because there isn't one.

16:05.000 --> 16:09.332
Um, I'm showing the reps
from Haspen Imaging our facilities.

16:09.333 --> 16:12.915
I've been wanting to upgrade all of our
rooms with their advanced IA technology.

16:12.916 --> 16:15.875
The board just approved my budget,
so I'm just getting a jump on things.

16:17.000 --> 16:19.707
Sounds good. Uh, let me know how it goes.

16:19.708 --> 16:20.750
Will do.

16:31.750 --> 16:34.749
Now you two stay here.
I'm gonna go find Dr. Heller.

16:34.750 --> 16:35.583
Nice job.

16:38.250 --> 16:39.416
Thank you.

16:46.666 --> 16:48.166
Hayden left a voicemail.

16:50.583 --> 16:51.750
Hey, it's me.

16:53.208 --> 16:55.374
Hey, Müller. You got something?

16:55.375 --> 16:56.624
Yes and no.

16:56.625 --> 16:59.790
Gertrude Payne isn't a signatory
for REH holdings.

16:59.791 --> 17:01.832
And she doesn't appear
in any of their corporate filings.

17:01.833 --> 17:03.915
I'm not sure you understand
how yes and no works.

17:03.916 --> 17:05.040
But here's where it gets interesting.

17:05.041 --> 17:08.041
That account was zeroed out
and closed two days ago.

17:08.625 --> 17:10.375
Any idea where the money went?

17:10.875 --> 17:14.916
I'm still working on it, but the wire
request came from a bank here in Boston.

17:15.583 --> 17:19.040
Okay, send me everything.
I'm gonna run it through the FBI.

17:19.041 --> 17:21.374
Look, offshore banking,
it lives in a gray area.

17:21.375 --> 17:25.124
Okay? And how I got this information,
lives in an even grayer one.

17:25.125 --> 17:26.582
It won't hold up in American court.

17:26.583 --> 17:29.457
If we can't tie anything to Gertrude,
then what good does it do us?

17:29.458 --> 17:31.750
She doesn't know we can't tie her to it.

17:34.333 --> 17:37.499
You wanna rattle her cage.
See if she slips.

17:37.500 --> 17:38.415
Exactly.

17:38.416 --> 17:41.457
All right, I'm at the hospital.
Call me after you talk to Gertrude.

17:41.458 --> 17:42.458
Okay.

17:51.708 --> 17:52.915
Kim.

17:52.916 --> 17:55.707
Oh, hey, Mr. Dreason.
I didn't think you were in today.

17:55.708 --> 17:58.874
Well, no rest for the wicked.
I'm looking for Dr. Heller.

17:58.875 --> 18:00.250
Is he on rounds or with a patient?

18:00.875 --> 18:03.457
- Actually, I think he left.
- I'm sorry?

18:03.458 --> 18:05.666
Oh, he was paged earlier,
and he never responded.

18:07.333 --> 18:08.582
Okay, uh, would--

18:08.583 --> 18:12.082
Would you mind trying to page him again
and also to, um, alert security?

18:12.083 --> 18:13.082
Thank you.

18:13.083 --> 18:14.832
- Is everything okay?
- Oh, yeah. Everything's fine.

18:14.833 --> 18:17.041
I just need to speak with him
before he goes today.

18:25.833 --> 18:29.457
Paging Dr. Heller.

18:29.458 --> 18:32.125
Dr. Heller,
please report to administration.

18:39.500 --> 18:40.750
Dr. Heller?

18:41.708 --> 18:42.708
Dr. Heller!

18:43.291 --> 18:44.500
- Ronald.
- Hey.

18:45.041 --> 18:45.875
Going somewhere?

18:46.791 --> 18:48.791
Heading home, actually. Family emergency.

18:49.416 --> 18:50.458
Well, we need to talk.

18:51.375 --> 18:53.665
Sorry, whatever it is
will have to wait until tomorrow.

18:53.666 --> 18:54.916
No, it can't wait.

18:55.833 --> 18:56.708
It's gonna have to.

18:58.083 --> 18:59.791
I know what happened at Berg.

19:02.791 --> 19:05.666
I've alerted security.
So you need to come with me now.

19:08.833 --> 19:09.958
And if I don't?

19:10.625 --> 19:11.958
It's either me,

19:12.583 --> 19:13.791
or them.

19:17.083 --> 19:18.083
Ronald.

19:19.208 --> 19:20.333
What's going on?

19:28.916 --> 19:32.207
We have learned that one of the men
traveling with David, Kyle Bergin,

19:32.208 --> 19:36.040
a known associate of the Irish mob,
was shot and killed by police fire…

19:36.041 --> 19:37.541
I'm touched. No flowers?

19:38.791 --> 19:40.290
Are you going soft on me, Max?

19:40.291 --> 19:44.832
Hey, what can I say? I came through
the other side a changed man.

19:44.833 --> 19:46.250
Is that why you're helping her?

19:47.291 --> 19:49.165
I don't know what you're referring to.

19:49.166 --> 19:52.874
I'm referring to the DNA test
that you ordered without checking with me.

19:52.875 --> 19:57.625
Sorry, I think I'm still just
a little groggy from the anesthesia.

20:01.625 --> 20:03.875
Is this really how you want
your career to end?

20:05.166 --> 20:07.290
I've canceled the DNA test.

20:07.291 --> 20:10.249
You see your daughter, you tell her
to stand down and come in.

20:10.250 --> 20:12.249
Otherwise, I will have both your badges.

20:12.250 --> 20:13.708
Tell you what.

20:15.625 --> 20:17.500
You can have mine right now.

20:18.500 --> 20:19.415
Excuse me?

20:19.416 --> 20:23.290
You still think this is a jailbreak?
Well, it's not. It's something more.

20:23.291 --> 20:25.790
And Sarah saw it from the jump!

20:25.791 --> 20:27.791
I'm asking you to trust her!

20:28.708 --> 20:31.665
Hell, you ought to trust her.
She's the best damn agent you got.

20:31.666 --> 20:33.999
She was, Max.

20:34.000 --> 20:35.250
Past tense.

20:36.208 --> 20:39.374
I'm pulling her from the field
and bringing her in.

20:39.375 --> 20:42.000
She's suspended until further notice.

20:43.958 --> 20:45.625
Enjoy retirement.

21:24.916 --> 21:26.165
I'm so sorry.

21:26.166 --> 21:28.125
You got nothing to be sorry about.

21:31.333 --> 21:33.207
What are you doing here?

21:33.208 --> 21:35.666
Ronald told me
why you're looking for Dr. Heller.

21:40.041 --> 21:41.958
It's not him, David.

21:42.875 --> 21:44.041
It can't be.

21:46.958 --> 21:48.708
Because you didn't go through with it?

21:50.083 --> 21:51.625
Um, no.

21:52.791 --> 21:56.790
No, I did, uh,
but Heller wasn't my doctor at Berg.

21:56.791 --> 21:59.749
I was treated by a woman.
She was the one that did the insemination.

21:59.750 --> 22:01.625
So whoever has Matthew,

22:02.875 --> 22:04.125
it's not him.

22:05.500 --> 22:08.540
But David, the day after I went to Berg,
I woke up sick.

22:08.541 --> 22:12.041
So I took an early pregnancy test,
and it was positive,

22:12.791 --> 22:15.958
which means I would've been pregnant
before I even went to Berg.

22:16.916 --> 22:18.166
That's why I didn't tell you.

22:19.625 --> 22:21.791
Because I knew Matthew was your son.

22:24.333 --> 22:26.083
He's yours, David.

22:39.458 --> 22:44.290
Hi. I am Special Agent Sarah Greer, FBI.
I'm looking for Dr. Cheryl Dreason.

22:44.291 --> 22:46.582
Uh, Dr. Dreason is in surgery.

22:46.583 --> 22:48.832
Is there something
that I can help you with?

22:48.833 --> 22:50.040
And you are?

22:50.041 --> 22:52.416
I'm sorry, I'm Ronald Dreason.
I'm the hospital administrator.

22:53.375 --> 22:56.166
Oh, Mr. Dreason.
You left off your better title.

22:56.916 --> 22:58.083
Husband.

22:59.583 --> 23:00.916
So, uh, what's this about?

23:01.625 --> 23:05.749
Has Cheryl been contacted
by her sister or ex-husband?

23:05.750 --> 23:07.332
No, no, no, no, no.

23:07.333 --> 23:11.290
You know, I-I-I'm pretty sure that we--
We went over all this with the FBI.

23:11.291 --> 23:13.707
Yeah, I-I know. I read the report.

23:13.708 --> 23:15.540
Can you tell me
when she'll be out of surgery?

23:15.541 --> 23:16.708
A few hours.

23:17.791 --> 23:19.416
Just like that? You don't need to check?

23:20.458 --> 23:21.625
No. No, no, no.

23:26.750 --> 23:27.916
Mr. Dreason…

23:30.083 --> 23:31.291
why are you lying to me?

23:32.916 --> 23:34.166
I'm not lying.

23:35.083 --> 23:36.166
Mm.

23:37.333 --> 23:39.749
You need to tell me
where Cheryl is right now,

23:39.750 --> 23:42.875
or I will place you under arrest
for obstruction.

23:48.916 --> 23:50.041
I can't do that.

23:53.375 --> 23:54.208
Officer.

23:58.041 --> 23:59.250
Arrest Mr. Dreason.

24:16.666 --> 24:17.666
Mother?

24:18.625 --> 24:19.625
Hayden?

24:23.666 --> 24:25.124
Oh, what a surprise.

24:25.125 --> 24:28.374
This is Detective Daniel Müller
from the Swiss police.

24:28.375 --> 24:30.791
Wow, that's a long ways away.

24:31.458 --> 24:33.125
- Pleasure.
- Likewise.

24:33.708 --> 24:35.415
What brings you all the way out here?

24:35.416 --> 24:39.499
Well, Detective Müller was just
informing me about a missing child

24:39.500 --> 24:42.790
from one of our
helping hands orphanages in Geneva.

24:42.791 --> 24:45.708
His name was Martin.
He-- He disappeared five years ago.

24:47.041 --> 24:49.165
I-I didn't hear about this.

24:49.166 --> 24:50.999
It was tragic.

24:51.000 --> 24:53.707
But the detective believes
that he has a break in the case.

24:53.708 --> 24:57.915
I was in the US on business, thought your
mother would like to hear this in person.

24:57.916 --> 25:00.000
And I so appreciate that.

25:01.208 --> 25:02.499
Hmm.

25:02.500 --> 25:04.915
New evidence has surfaced in the case,

25:04.916 --> 25:07.666
connecting it to a murder
right here in Boston.

25:08.500 --> 25:10.375
A little boy named Matthew Burroughs.

25:15.541 --> 25:17.207
- Hey.
- Where are you?

25:17.208 --> 25:19.582
I'm at the hospital.
Look, I know this sounds crazy,

25:19.583 --> 25:21.457
but I think David Burroughs is here.

25:21.458 --> 25:23.791
Yeah, it does. But keep talking.

25:24.291 --> 25:26.624
Okay, I came back
to talk to Cheryl, his ex-wife.

25:26.625 --> 25:28.290
I ran into her husband,

25:28.291 --> 25:30.082
who happens to be
the hospital administrator.

25:30.083 --> 25:32.582
He would not tell me where she is,
so I arrested him.

25:32.583 --> 25:34.082
Wait, whoa, whoa, whoa.

25:34.083 --> 25:38.749
You arrested the hospital administrator?
How did you--? You're on leave!

25:38.750 --> 25:42.290
Relax, okay? Your blood pressure.
I had a BPD officer do it.

25:42.291 --> 25:44.457
You need to listen to me, okay?

25:44.458 --> 25:46.665
Julie is having you pulled from the field.

25:46.666 --> 25:48.040
This is serious, Sarah.

25:48.041 --> 25:49.874
Okay? She knows about the DNA test,

25:49.875 --> 25:52.124
and she knows
you're still working the case.

25:52.125 --> 25:54.832
You can't be running around
flashing your badge everywhere

25:54.833 --> 25:56.790
and arresting hospital administrators.

25:56.791 --> 25:58.165
FBI, Agent Sarah Greer,

25:58.166 --> 26:00.665
I need to see all of the security footage
on this floor for the last hour.

26:00.666 --> 26:01.624
I'll call you back.

26:01.625 --> 26:03.416
What-- Don't you call--

26:07.750 --> 26:10.832
Matthew Burroughs
was killed by his father,

26:10.833 --> 26:12.166
who recently escaped from prison.

26:12.875 --> 26:14.957
It's been all over the news.

26:14.958 --> 26:15.958
Yes.

26:16.666 --> 26:19.499
But, uh, I believe
that the body that they found

26:19.500 --> 26:22.375
in Matthew Burroughs's room that night
was actually Martin.

26:23.208 --> 26:24.915
And you have proof of this?

26:24.916 --> 26:25.916
Not yet.

26:26.666 --> 26:27.833
But I will.

26:28.958 --> 26:31.124
You see, Martin had
a rare genetic disorder.

26:31.125 --> 26:32.915
The FBI is running a DNA test

26:32.916 --> 26:35.750
on the blood collected
from the crime scene that night.

26:36.333 --> 26:39.707
And when the results come back,
I believe they will prove

26:39.708 --> 26:42.791
that it was actually Martin
who they found in the house that night,

26:43.375 --> 26:44.666
not Matthew Burroughs.

26:48.000 --> 26:49.875
I-I'm sorry, I…

26:51.000 --> 26:54.082
I don't understand
what this has to do with me.

26:54.083 --> 26:58.333
A missing boy from your orphanage
shows up dead in your hometown.

26:59.416 --> 27:01.125
You don't think that's suspicious?

27:05.500 --> 27:06.416
How dare you?

27:07.333 --> 27:09.457
How dare you suggest

27:09.458 --> 27:12.250
that I had anything
to do with a child's death?

27:16.083 --> 27:17.416
You can leave.

27:25.583 --> 27:27.208
Thank you for your time.

27:37.041 --> 27:39.416
Robert Edward Harold Payne.

27:40.041 --> 27:41.666
Yes, my late father.

27:43.125 --> 27:44.500
R-E-H.

27:49.791 --> 27:50.833
It's funny.

27:51.708 --> 27:54.082
I just came across
a holding company in the Caymans

27:54.083 --> 27:55.541
with exactly the same initials.

27:59.333 --> 28:00.500
Must be a coincidence.

28:02.041 --> 28:03.666
- It must be.
- Mm.

28:09.750 --> 28:11.540
Just because we were wrong about Heller

28:11.541 --> 28:13.874
doesn't mean we were wrong
about what happened, right?

28:13.875 --> 28:16.040
We just have to figure out
who your donor was.

28:16.041 --> 28:19.332
Yeah, how? Whoever it was erased the file
and is covering their tracks.

28:19.333 --> 28:22.082
- What are you talking about?
- We went to Berg to pull your file.

28:22.083 --> 28:23.000
It was missing.

28:24.833 --> 28:27.625
It's not missing.
It's just not under my name.

28:29.750 --> 28:30.833
It's under yours.

28:31.416 --> 28:32.333
Mine?

28:32.916 --> 28:36.249
I'm sorry, okay? I used your name.
I-I should have told you.

28:36.250 --> 28:39.750
I-I should have told both of you,
but I-I didn't want you to find out.

28:41.500 --> 28:43.832
Wait, how would the donor know
you used my name?

28:43.833 --> 28:45.540
It still has to be someone at Berg.

28:45.541 --> 28:48.208
Someone who knows us both
well enough to put it all together.

28:48.875 --> 28:52.708
I don't know anyone there.
I mean, other than my doctor.

28:56.291 --> 28:57.125
Yes, you do.

28:58.291 --> 28:59.541
You both do.

29:00.541 --> 29:02.333
I got it all wrong.

29:03.750 --> 29:05.166
You weren't the target.

29:09.458 --> 29:10.416
Rachel was.

29:14.416 --> 29:15.416
Right.

29:17.041 --> 29:19.374
I'm starting to become…

29:19.375 --> 29:22.458
That's because he wanted me
to get pregnant, not you.

29:27.083 --> 29:28.458
Wait, wait, wait.

29:31.875 --> 29:33.249
What is it?

29:33.250 --> 29:35.790
The missing photos from Six Flags.

29:35.791 --> 29:37.624
Is this Davidson Photography?

29:37.625 --> 29:40.040
I was sent all your photos,
but I'm missing three.

29:40.041 --> 29:41.833
And I'm wondering
if you can email them to me.

29:45.708 --> 29:48.666
I'm starting to become…

29:49.791 --> 29:51.125
Payne Industries?

29:51.708 --> 29:53.583
They rented out the whole park that day.

29:55.166 --> 29:57.291
We didn't break up. You broke up with me.

29:58.000 --> 29:59.250
Biggest mistake of my life.

30:00.500 --> 30:01.625
Will you give me another shot?

30:03.416 --> 30:05.750
Rachel, there's something
I need you to know.

30:06.666 --> 30:09.250
I love you. I always will.

30:15.083 --> 30:17.416
Go

30:21.291 --> 30:25.500
Just a matter of time…

30:26.916 --> 30:28.625
Oh, fuck.

30:30.166 --> 30:31.666
Excuse me, Detective.

30:35.583 --> 30:39.416
Just a matter of time

30:40.750 --> 30:43.457
Before you

30:43.458 --> 30:45.457
Go

30:45.458 --> 30:46.833
It's Hayden.

30:49.541 --> 30:52.333
And I'm sorry for the lies

30:53.375 --> 30:56.458
I told you…

31:00.125 --> 31:01.833
He's had Matthew this whole time.

31:07.291 --> 31:11.624
FBI! David Burroughs, you're under arrest!
Hands up! On your head now!

31:11.625 --> 31:13.707
All of you, where I can see them!

31:13.708 --> 31:16.625
No
